+        Resolved once per device and reused. Sampling free memory per forward
+        would make the chunk count, and therefore prefill throughput, a
+        function of transient allocator state; the first non-capture prefill
+        runs after warmup and graph capture, when the KV pool is already
+        reserved and free memory is at its steady state.
